  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). 'Component Unit' 121,057 under other financing sources (Hospital Bond debt service fund) recorded as other_financing; transfers all zero. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3, Total column; totals 2,305,261 equal the Statement of Net Position p1). Detail: budget-and-actual schedules for General (pp5-6), Road (p7), Highway Buyback (p8) and Inheritance Tax (p9) funds; nonmajor funds from the combining schedule Schedule 2 (p10) columns (Special Revenue Funds combined, Hospital Bond), because Schedule 4 (pp11-13) has 15 fund columns and Schedule 5 (pp14-16) prints only fund totals (not recorded, to avoid double counting). General Fund budget 'Taxes' 1,594,749 split by the p4 General column (property 1,466,997 + motor vehicle 127,752, exact); Road 'Taxes' 659,939 equals the Road property taxes on p4; Inheritance Tax fund 'Local' 307,311 split by the p4 column (inheritance tax 306,643 + miscellaneous 668). General and Road budget 'State'/'Local' groupings don't tie to the statement lines (differences 2,242 and 1,050), kept as printed. Read pages 1-16 of 16"
